  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARM: Promoting of accountability and public oversight of Public Procurement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Finance of the Republic of Armenia Deputy Minister of Finance asked Good Governance Fund to support the procurement reforms. The project implemented by Union of Informed Citizens on-governmental organization will strengthen civil society organizations&apos; role in procurement monitoring and will help the Government of Armenia to improve the public procurement system. Government of Armenia express interest to establish mechanisms for &#x201c;independent&#x201d; sources of funding to qualified civil society organizations to carry out procurement monitoring. It will increase public oversight and improve accountability and will also contribute to increased oversight by the civil society and the media.</narrative>
  </description>
